Package: keyboard-chattering-fix
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Triforcey <judsonwebdesign@gmail.com>
Depends: python3, python3-libevdev
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Description: Filter mechanical keyboard chattering on Linux (systemd user service)
 Fork of finkrer/KeyboardChatteringFix-Linux. Ships the original tools as-is
 plus a systemd user service (keyboard-debounce.service) that is enabled by
 default. The service targets the keyboard chosen with
 set-keyboard-debounce-target (saved in ~/.config/debounce-keyboard) and
 exits silently when no target is configured. It claims access to input
 devices itself via SupplementaryGroups=input.
